    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Provence is considered the personal Fief of Genevi&egrave;ve Orseau, the oldest known French Toreador, credited with having driven Setite influence out of southern France centuries ago. Avignon, famous for its arts festival, remains a favored retreat for Toreador of every lineage under her long, largely unchallenged rule.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Serene, cultured, and utterly secure in your authority &mdash; centuries of unchallenged rule have made you gracious in victory and merciless toward anything resembling Setite influence.</p>",
    "notes": "Drove Setite influence out of southern France historically; would react with particular ferocity to any resurgence of Setite activity in her domain.",
